# Paths opengrep (the Scan workflow) skips. This file REPLACES opengrep's
# built-in ignore list, so keep the :include; checked with a full-repo scan
# that adding it surfaces no new findings. The scanner reads this file and
# .gitignore as ASCII: a non-ASCII character in either (an em dash in a
# comment did it) crashes opengrep and fails the required `scan` check.
:include .gitignore

# Local-devnet compose files: the indexer's plain-websocket node URLs (Docker
# network only) and its public dummy APP__INFRA__SECRET trip
# insecure-websocket and generic-secret. GitHub code scanning ignores inline nosemgrep (SARIF
# suppressions), so these are excluded by path instead.
compose.yml
